  "description": "In this video, the couple, Bimla and K.S. Badwal, both speakers of the Marcha dialect of the Rongpo language of India discuss the nostalgic past of each other's hometowns in their native language. Interviewed in 2019 by Subhashish Panigrahi during his 2021 documentary film, MarginalizedAadhaar. Unused or trimmed archival footage from the film was edited by Panigrahi and published under the OpenSpeaks Archives project in 2025. Hindi subtitles are by Kimmi Pal, native speaker and OpenSpeaks Fellow, with edits by Panigrahi, and English translations by Panigrahi.",
